 Fast, agile, and difficult to hit, Manhacks can quickly overwhelm an unprepared target. Keep your crowbar ready, or risk getting sliced to pieces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turret</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deadly automated defense system that locks onto movement and fires on sight. These sentry guns are stationary but highly dangerous, capable of cutting down anyone who enters their line of fire. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tripmine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lethal explosive trap, usually placed in doorways or narrow corridors. Triggering its laser sensor results in instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895720/extras/3240354c07510682ab291bd53583e562.poster.avif?t=1742746235\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895720/extras/3240354c07510682ab291bd53583e562.webm?t=1742746235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895720/extras/3240354c07510682ab291bd53583e562.mp4?t=1742746235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Unforgiving Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Experience a world plunged into chaos. Isolation, uncertainty, and the constant threat of death shape every moment of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Combat is not just about shooting. Manage your ammunition carefully\u2014you don\u2019t find pre-loaded magazines, so you\u2019ll have to refill them yourself. Every bullet counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Tactical Melee Combat</strong> \u2013 The crowbar isn\u2019t just a weapon\u2014it\u2019s your lifeline. Use it to block enemy attacks, reducing incoming damage or even deflecting fatal blows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Adaptive AI Enemies</strong> \u2013 Enemies are not just mindless obstacles; they react dynamically to your presence. Whether it\u2019s the relentless pursuit of zombies, the ambush tactics of headcrabs, or the precision of turrets, every encounter is a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Deadly Environmental Hazards</strong> \u2013 The world itself is as dangerous as the creatures within it. Tripmines, automated turrets, and other hazards make every step forward a potential deathtrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong> \u2013 Nothing is as it seems. Your reality shifts as you uncover disturbing truths behind the catastrophe. Are you fighting an alien invasion, or is the real enemy something much closer to home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>High-Risk Combat</strong> \u2013 Weapons are powerful, but only if used wisely. Careless shooting will leave you defenseless, forcing you to scavenge, plan, and make every shot matter.</p>",
